## Core Business Chain — The Intellectual Core

The client's real workflow (Meeting 1 + Meeting 2), NOT a generic CRM:

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    INQ[("Inquiry<br/>SWA-{year}-INQ-{seq:03d}<br/>🟢 BUILT")] -->|convert| CLIEST{"Client exists?"}
    CLIEST -->|No| CLT[("Create Client<br/>SWA-{year}-CLT-{seq:03d}<br/>🟢 BUILT")]
    CLIEST -->|Yes| REUSE[("Reuse existing Client<br/>🟢 BUILT")]
    CLT --> PROJ[("Project<br/>SWA-{year}-PRJ-{seq:03d}<br/>🟢 BUILT")]
    REUSE --> PROJ
    PROJ --> SA[("Service Agreement<br/>SWA-{year}-SA-{seq:03d}<br/>🟢 BUILT")]
    SA --> TKN[("Token (unit of work)<br/>SWA-{year}-TKN-{seq:03d}<br/>🟢 BUILT")]
    TKN --> DRN[("Document Reference<br/>SWA-{year}-DBR-{seq:03d}<br/>DBR/KDR share counter<br/>🟢 BUILT")]
    DRN --> TIME[("Time Log → Invoice / GST<br/>🟢 BUILT")]
    TIME --> SUST[("Sustainability metrics<br/>SWA-{year}-SM-{seq:03d}<br/>🟢 BUILT")]

    INQ -->|Meeting 1 + Meeting 2<br/>Viraj confirmed| VERIFIED[("ID scheme confirmed<br/>not guessed<br/>ADR-0002<br/>🟢 BUILT")]
    VERIFIED -.-> INQ
```

**Reference IDs:** `SWA-{year}-{TYPE}-{seq:03d}`, generated atomically by `reference_id_service.py`, counters reset per calendar year. Confirmed by Viraj Aug 2026 — see `docs/decisions/0002-core-id-chain-gap.md`.

**Key flows:**
- Inquiry → Client (convert: check if exists, only create if not) — `POST /inquiries/{id}/convert`
- Client → Project (lifecycle state machine) — `POST /projects/{id}/transition`
- Project → Service Agreement → Token → Document Reference
- Document Reference → Time Log → Invoice (with GST) → Sustainability metrics

